{"tokens":"/* Playai design tokens.\n   Every colour, radius and type size in the app comes from here.\n   If you are about to write a hex value in a component, stop.\n\n   Names match mockup.html, docs/DESIGN.md and docs/SCREENS.md exactly. They were\n   spelled differently here once and it is the kind of drift that costs an afternoon:\n   three artefacts agreed, this file did not. */\n\n:root {\n  /* Surfaces */\n  --pg: #ffffff;           /* page */\n  --bg2: #f7f6f3;          /* inset areas, disabled tiles, progress track */\n\n  /* Ink — warm near-black, never #000 */\n  --ink: #37352f;          /* primary text, primary button fill, drawn strokes */\n  --ink2: #787774;         /* secondary text */\n  --ink3: #9b9a97;         /* captions, disabled */\n  --on-ink: #ffffff;       /* text on an ink fill */\n\n  /* Rules */\n  --ln: #edece9;           /* hairline dividers, 1px, horizontal only */\n  --ln2: #dfdeda;          /* dashed placeholders, dead-state outlines */\n  --border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); /* interactive borders */\n\n  /* Colour appears in exactly two places: an avatar tile, and a highlighter.\n     Eight tiles because a room holds eight players and the tile is the player's\n     identity — it has to stay distinct in a list of eight. */\n  --mark: #fbf3db;         /* highlighter behind text */\n  --tYel: #fbf3db;         /* avatar tiles — assign per player, keep stable */\n  --tRed: #fbe4e4;\n  --tBlu: #ddebf1;\n  --tGrn: #ddedea;\n  --tPur: #eae4f2;\n  --tOrg: #faebdd;\n  --tPnk: #f4dfeb;\n  --tGry: #f1f0ee;\n\n  /* Radius — nothing above 6px */\n  --r-control: 4px;\n  --r-tile: 6px;\n\n  /* Type */\n  --font: \"Inter\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  --fs-hero: 46px;\n  --fs-title: 26px;\n  --fs-display: 84px;      /* target time */\n  --fs-count: 110px;       /* countdown digit */\n  --fs-body: 16px;\n  --fs-row: 15px;\n  --fs-caption: 12px;\n\n  --fw-regular: 400;\n  --fw-medium: 500;\n  --fw-semibold: 600;\n\n  /* Spacing */\n  --pad-screen: 24px;\n  --pad-top: 46px;         /* plus safe-area inset */\n  --pad-bottom: 30px;\n  --row-gap: 7px;\n}\n\n/* Every number in this app lives in a column. Without this, results jitter. */\n.num,\n[data-numeric] {\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n/* Dark mode is not built. When it is, it is these eight values and nothing else.\n   Do not add a second set of components.\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  :root {\n    --pg: #191918;\n    --bg2: #222220;\n    --ink: #f0efec;\n    --ink2: #a5a29b;\n    --ink3: #7b7872;\n    --on-ink: #191918;\n    --ln: #2a2a28;\n    --ln2: #3a3a37;\n  }\n}\n*/\n","sprites":"<symbol id=\"t\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3.5 12.5q3 1.5 4.8 5.4Q12 8.4 20.5 3.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"x\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 5q6 6.5 13 14M18.5 5.4Q12 12 5.2 18.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"sw\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><path d=\"M42 12q8-2 16 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M46 13q4-1 8 0l1 8q-5-1-10 0z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M50 21q30 0 35 30t-25 39Q28 96 17 68 7 40 30 26q9-5 20-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M50 34v5M69 55h-5M50 76v-5M31 55h5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M50 55 66 39\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"55\" r=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M76 24q6-4 11-2M82 40q7 0 11 3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></symbol>\n<symbol id=\"ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\"><path d=\"M104 20q64 2 76 46t-40 88q-52 44-92 12T30 68Q52 24 104 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-l